},{"title":"Joby Aviation Falls 6% as Air Taxi Selloff Deepens; Archer Aviation Drops 4%, EHang Slides 2%","src":"24/7 Wall St.","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxOMi1tTHREZVZyalM5bERxb0hzcG53QTNNOGlDeG44WXFOY2VUS20yWElDNmlkeFdIRzBvOEFzT0liNThuSUpkcm1qR0lKclJfR0hnV2Q5eEJXUk0yWjJ2UzN6Q3VRVXVHNG1HNDJfSHFyLWRsTkF0WnN4LWJsalpINVRWZXRHa3pmZ0JtNTVWU05HQTYtV3ZBTml1aURMekZvRWRLNjIyMlpRMjhQd1h4bDNJTkhkcXlfOWRvalEyR1l6Y0t3eTF1am1vYk4?oc=5","date":"2026-11-17","zh":"由於空中出租車拋售加劇，Joby Aviation 股價下跌 6%； Archer Aviation 下跌 4%，EHang 下跌 2%"},{"title":"Archer Aviation Stock Gains Defense Revenue With Boeing Unit Deal","src":"Simply Wall St","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-11-16","zh":"阿徹航空股票透過波音子公司交易獲得國防收入"},{"title":"Archer Aviation Drops 6%, EHang Slides 7%, Joby Falls 5%: Is Cathie Wood Right to Keep Buying Air Taxi Stocks?","src":"24/7 Wall St.","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-11-16","zh":"Archer Aviation 下跌 6%，EHang 下跌 7%，Joby 下跌 5%：Cathie Wood 繼續買進空中計程車股票是否正確？"},{"title":"Cathie Wood Buys Archer, Down More Than 40% in 2026. Is Joby the Better Air Taxi Bet?","src":"24/7 Wall St.","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxPQUxySGNNV01PbTY0YXBXVS1IWkJSdGVhZWc2Z0JxTm5PM3ZQaGdaWmd0bURzTXV1ZGpHOC1EUHN5OWU1cEw4MVdNZTFjbzgwVkdneFh2RGJ2cXhvWFVUbkNTU05rWUZaa1pFMHl2eWswRXRvZXhEamRGcklLa1EzZnRSYlg1OXFmQ0pkSnlhWWh0Si1uM3JJLTF5emJfVjhIRDlUTzhPOGtuajk2eVZLb24zOHVlMTd3UVo3dXZQSHNieGs?oc=5","date":"2026-11-16","zh":"Cathie Wood 收購了 Archer，2026 年股價下跌超過 40%。 Joby 是更好的空中計程車賭注嗎？"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":3},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":3},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":2},{"name":"國防/軍工","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-03-02","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1824502/000182450226000019/achr-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Archer is developing the technologies and aircraft to power the future of advanced aviation. We are building a platform to deliver advanced aircraft, technologies and services to customers worldwide across commercial and defense sectors.","zh":"阿徹正在開發技術和飛機，為先進航空的未來提供動力。我們正在建立一個平台，為全球商業和國防領域的客戶提供先進的飛機、技術和服務。"},{"en":"Midnight is our electric vertical take-off and landing (\"eVTOL\") aircraft purpose-built for air taxi operations globally. To prepare for commercial operations, we are working with aviation authorities, governments, and strategic partners in key U.S. and international markets to certify Midnight and build out air taxi networks. These planned networks will connect major population and business centers with key transportation hubs in select metropolitan areas through partnerships with airline operators to integrate eVTOL flights into passenger journeys and collaborations with infrastructure partners to develop vertiports.","zh":"Midnight 是我們的電動垂直起降 (“eVTOL”) 飛機，專為全球空中計程車營運而設計。為了準備商業運營，我們正在與美國和國際主要市場的航空當局、政府和戰略合作夥伴合作，對 Midnight 進行認證並建立空中計程車網路。這些規劃的網路將透過與航空公司營運商合作將電動垂直起降航班整合到旅客旅程中，並與基礎設施合作夥伴合作開發垂直機場，將主要人口和商業中心與選定大都市區的主要交通樞紐連接起來。"},{"en":"In the U.S., we have applied to participate in the eVTOL Integration Pilot Program (\"eIPP\"), a White House initiative to accelerate air taxi deployments in American cities. We have partnered with cities across California, Florida, Texas, Georgia, and New York on multiple applications to launch initial air taxi operations under the eIPP later this year. As part of broader commercialization strategy in the U.S., we recently acquired control of Hawthorne Municipal Airport (\"Hawthorne Airport\") located near Los Angeles International Airport and Downtown Los Angeles. We plan for the airport to serve as the operational hub for our Los Angeles network and an innovation hub for developing and commercializing next-generation AI-powered aviation technologies.","zh":"在美國，我們已申請參加 eVTOL 整合試點計畫（「eIPP」），這是一項白宮倡議，旨在加速美國城市空中計程車的部署。我們已與加州、佛羅裡達州、德州、喬治亞州和紐約州的城市合作，申請多項申請，以便在今年稍後根據 eIPP 啟動初步空中計程車業務。作為美國更廣泛商業化策略的一部分，我們最近獲得了位於洛杉磯國際機場和洛杉磯市中心附近的霍桑市機場（「霍桑機場」）的控制權。我們計劃將該機場作為洛杉磯網路的營運中心，以及開發和商業化下一代人工智慧航空技術的創新中心。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"The commercial aerospace and defense industries include many strong U.S. and international competitors. Key competitive factors include long development cycles, rapid technological change, and intense competition. In the defense industry specifically, it is typical to work on development programs in partnership with companies who may also be your competitors and involve a competitive bid process to be awarded a contract.","zh":"商業航空航太和國防工業包括許多強大的美國和國際競爭對手。主要競爭因素包括開發週期長、技術變革快、競爭激烈。特別是在國防工業中，通常與可能也是您競爭對手的公司合作開發項目，並涉及競爭性投標過程以獲得合約。"},{"en":"In our planned commercial air taxi service, we also compete with ground based alternatives, such as personal automobiles and ride-sharing services, as well as existing aircraft and helicopter charter services. The market for these services is intensely competitive, with key differentiating factors including safety, trip duration, technology, overall user experience, and cost.","zh":"在我們計劃的商業空中計程車服務中，我們也與地面替代服務競爭，例如個人汽車和共乘服務，以及現有的飛機和直升機包機服務。這些服務的市場競爭非常激烈，關鍵的差異化因素包括安全性、行程持續時間、技術、整體使用者體驗和成本。"}],"segments":{},"peers":["JOBY","SOUN","BBAI","RKLB","RGTI"]}}